OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud thickens during the early
OL,6,Fmorning, but breaks widely by the
OL,7,Fafternoon to leave sunny spells and
OL,8,Fdry conditions for most. Winds
OL,9,Fcontinue to ease. Temperatures just
OL,10,Fabove average.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FPartly cloudy with skies
OL,13,Fclearing overnight, winds become light
OL,14,Fand variable. Widespread fog patches
OL,15,Fdevelop by the morning and could be
OL,16,Fdense across Norfolk.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
