OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FEarly morning fog patches
OL,6,Fwill slowly lift and clear becoming
OL,7,Fpartly cloudy during the morning. Some
OL,8,Flonger sunny intervals develop during
OL,9,Fthe afternoon, especially along the
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FVariable
OL,13,Fcloud and sunny spells on Friday.
OL,14,FPotential for mist and fog patches
OL,15,Fovernight then clearing slowly.
OL,16,FCloudier on Saturday and Sunday. Winds
OL,17,Fbecoming light. Mild by day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
